<text format-version="0.2" work-id="w-songshu" book-id="b-songshu-049" chapter-id="c-songshu-049-kuai-guocai-huidu" source-id="s-songshu-049-kuai-guocai-huidu-ws2118585">
  <p id="c-songshu-049-kuai-guocai-huidu:p001" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter">入關迎桂陽公<persName id="c-songshu-049-kuai-guocai-huidu:p001:m0006" ref="4ly_56b_ld0">義真</persName>。<persName id="c-songshu-049-kuai-guocai-huidu:p001:m0009" ref="4ly_56b_ld0">義真</persName>還至青埿，為<persName id="c-songshu-049-kuai-guocai-huidu:p001:m0017" ref="fd5_0ae_506">佛佛</persName>虜所追，<persName id="c-songshu-049-kuai-guocai-huidu:p001:m0023" ref="sn4_yf4_esv">恩</persName>斷後，力戰連日。<persName id="c-songshu-049-kuai-guocai-huidu:p001:m0032" ref="4ly_56b_ld0">義真</persName>前軍奔散，<persName id="c-songshu-049-kuai-guocai-huidu:p001:m0039" ref="sn4_yf4_esv">恩</persName>軍人亦盡，為虜所執，死於虜中。子<persName id="c-songshu-049-kuai-guocai-huidu:p001:m0056" ref="sn4_yf4_esv_A">國才</persName>嗣。<persName id="c-songshu-049-kuai-guocai-huidu:p001:m0060" ref="sn4_yf4_esv_A">國才</persName>卒，子<persName id="c-songshu-049-kuai-guocai-huidu:p001:m0065" ref="sn4_yf4_esv_AA">慧度</persName>嗣。<persName id="c-songshu-049-kuai-guocai-huidu:p001:m0069" ref="sn4_yf4_esv_AA">慧度</persName>卒，無子，國除。</p>
</text>
